                <pb facs="0911" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg823"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Prinkipo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-07-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 23,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that the under secretary of state for foreign affairs
                    informed him by command of His Majesty that the Sultan would receive Mr.
                    Leishman immediately after the Selamnik ceremony next Friday.)</p>
            </div>
